<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 to 1.50 higher than Tuesday's close. Top $58.00 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   230-260 lbs    56.00-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   260-270 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs    42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  over 500 lbs    48.00-51.00</p>
</text>
